<title>INDONESIA: INDONESIA SAYS TIGHT RUPIAH TO BE EASED GRADUALLY.</title>
<headline>INDONESIA SAYS TIGHT RUPIAH TO BE EASED GRADUALLY.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian Finance Minister Mar'ie Muhammad said on Thursday the current policy of tightening rupiah liquidity would be eased gradually.</p>
<p>&quot;The tight rupiah policy on the fiscal and monetary side will be adjusted according to market conditions, that means it will be eased in steps,&quot; Mar'ie told reporters.</p>
</text>
